<title>USA: National Vision stake raised by WisdomTree.</title>
<headline>National Vision stake raised by WisdomTree.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including WisdomTree Capital Management Inc said on Tuesday it raised its stake in National Vision Associates Ltd to 1,664,170 common shares, or 8.1 percent of the total outstanding.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought 251,000 shares between Feb. 11 and 24 at prices ranging from $4.68 to $5.02 each.</p>
<p>Others named in the filing group were WisdomTree Associates LP and WisdomTree Offshore Ltd.</p>
